600	/// "## C6a" and "## C6b" (`vp9_alpha_webm`'s first in "## C5"'s fix pass): one fresh Release
601	/// instance per key and size, the resident peak above the instance's own after a warming
602	/// frame, and the export's wall time. The TIME figures are C6b's: on an idle machine, the
